{"id":"2e7227755a8473e0","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-arithmetical-proof-calculus.md","title":"Arithmetical Proof Calculus","display":"df-arithmetical-proof-calculus — Arithmetical Proof Calculus","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-arithmetical-proof-calculus","aliases":["89-df-arithmetical-proof-calculus"],"display":"df-arithmetical-proof-calculus — Arithmetical Proof Calculus","depends_on":["[[89-df-arithmetical-language]]"],"created":"2026-10-05","revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-arithmetical-proof-calculus"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-arithmetical-proof-calculus</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-arithmetical-proof-calculus — Arithmetical Proof Calculus"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a257e5b1de6880b7\" href=\"?note=a257e5b1de6880b7\" title=\"89-df-arithmetical-language\">89-df-arithmetical-language</a></span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\">\\(A,B\\)</span> 为算术公式，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\">\\(t\\)</span> 为项，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y\">\\(x,y\\)</span> 为变量。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{LogAx}\">\\(\\mathsf{LogAx}\\)</span> 是下列模式的全体实例：命题重言式；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall x A\\to A[t/x]\">\\(\\forall x A\\to A[t/x]\\)</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\">\\(t\\)</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 可自由代入）；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall x(A\\to B)\\to(A\\to\\forall xB)\">\\(\\forall x(A\\to B)\\to(A\\to\\forall xB)\\)</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\notin\\mathrm{FV}(A)\">\\(x\\notin\\mathrm{FV}(A)\\)</span>）；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t=t\">\\(t=t\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t=u\\to(A[t/x]\\to A[u/x])\">\\(t=u\\to(A[t/x]\\to A[u/x])\\)</span>（两次代入均避免捕获）。</li>\n<li>数词实例化、公式相等和模式识别均在有限语法树上判定。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}arithmetical\\text{-}proof\\text{-}calculus}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nT\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}} A\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\n\\exists m\\ge1\\ \\exists\\langle A_0,\\ldots,A_{m-1}\\rangle\n\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{PA}}^m\\ \n\\bigl[A_{m-1}=A\\ \\land\\\n\\forall i&lt;m\\bigl(&amp;A_i\\in T\\cup\\mathsf{LogAx}\\\\\n{}\\lor{}&amp;\\exists j,k&lt;i\\ (A_k=(A_j\\to A_i))\\\\\n{}\\lor{}&amp;\\exists j&lt;i\\ \\exists x\\ (A_i=\\forall xA_j)\\bigr)\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}arithmetical\\text{-}proof\\text{-}calculus}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nT\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}} A\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\n\\exists m\\ge1\\ \\exists\\langle A_0,\\ldots,A_{m-1}\\rangle\n\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{PA}}^m\\ \n\\bigl[A_{m-1}=A\\ \\land\\\n\\forall i&lt;m\\bigl(&amp;A_i\\in T\\cup\\mathsf{LogAx}\\\\\n{}\\lor{}&amp;\\exists j,k&lt;i\\ (A_k=(A_j\\to A_i))\\\\\n{}\\lor{}&amp;\\exists j&lt;i\\ \\exists x\\ (A_i=\\forall xA_j)\\bigr)\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，第 2 章，印刷页 15–20；PDF 页码为印刷页加 39。本条采用本目录的等价语法约定。\n固定通常的经典一阶等号演算，写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\vdash A\">\\(T\\vdash A\\)</span> 时采用本关系。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 的公理都是句子，因此全称化不受开放理论假设的变量条件影响；若讨论开放假设的局部推导，必须另加全称化的限制。对仅可枚举的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>，证明码还保存公理被枚举出的有限计算证书，不能直接把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in T\">\\(A_i\\in T\\)</span> 当作可判定检查。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-arithmetical-language","status":"resolved","id":"a257e5b1de6880b7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-arithmetical-language]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}","display":false},{"tex":"A,B","display":false},{"tex":"t","display":false},{"tex":"x,y","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{LogAx}","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall x A\\to A[t/x]","display":false},{"tex":"t","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall x(A\\to B)\\to(A\\to\\forall xB)","display":false},{"tex":"x\\notin\\mathrm{FV}(A)","display":false},{"tex":"t=t","display":false},{"tex":"t=u\\to(A[t/x]\\to A[u/x])","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}arithmetical\\text{-}proof\\text{-}calculus}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nT\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}} A\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\n\\exists m\\ge1\\ \\exists\\langle A_0,\\ldots,A_{m-1}\\rangle\n\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{PA}}^m\\ \n\\bigl[A_{m-1}=A\\ \\land\\\n\\forall i<m\\bigl(&A_i\\in T\\cup\\mathsf{LogAx}\\\\\n{}\\lor{}&\\exists j,k<i\\ (A_k=(A_j\\to A_i))\\\\\n{}\\lor{}&\\exists j<i\\ \\exists x\\ (A_i=\\forall xA_j)\\bigr)\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"T\\vdash A","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"A_i\\in T","display":false}],"bytes":1850,"backlinks":[{"id":"508219e8b4c7dadf","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"86ad48bbd1843ed6","anch